          ],
          "sectionId": 32524
        }
      ],
      "title": "武道极意·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32525001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "这……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "这是怎么回事呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "绿子，场上到底是什么情况？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "唔……同根同源的武者之间有时会发生这样的情况。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "看起来，两人都在等待完美的出招时机。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "已经过去了两分钟……两位仓田选手仍然一动不动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "线上的观众请注意，这并非直播画面的卡顿，这是正在现场上演的事实。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "没错，两人的交锋早就已经开始了——虽然是在精神层面上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "预先进行对决的脑内演练，可行的进攻路线，对方可能的反应……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "纯粹的意志力的比拼，心念在不断地碰撞，两个人都在等待——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "等待对方注意力涣散，露出破绽的那一刻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "果然是「读心」的技巧吗……但这时间也太久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "不会要一直等下去了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "也有可能，沉不住气的那一方，会在时机到来前就出手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "……有不好的预感。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呼——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "真乃选手动了！她直接冲向了「王者」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "糟糕……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "「王者」预判了真乃选手的进攻路线，稍一躲闪便接上了超高速的连续直拳！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我能跟上他的速度……我能够躲开……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "「王者」的重拳捕捉了空隙，直击真乃选手的肩膀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真乃！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525025",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "真乃选手倒在了地上！难道胜负已经分出来了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525026",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "观众席哑然无声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "喂——你可不止这种程度吧，快站起来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "主人，鼓励一下真乃，这样下去……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "咦，主人呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32525030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "刚才说是去给我们买冰棍了……要花这么久吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-738",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
