      "title": "武道极意·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32526001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "|101|，请你让开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「阿尔贝尔」和我不能容忍这样的事态。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你应该也清楚吧，会场里面正在上演的所谓对决。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哥哥毫不留手地打妹妹……难道是可以容忍的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「管理局」那群家伙，居然还把这个当作吸引人气的卖点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "32526008",
              "text": "这是两个武者之间的公平对决。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "32526008",
              "text": "这是武道世家的兄妹间的相处方式。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "32526007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "所以，就这样放任他们继续下去吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这也是真乃自己的意愿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "她已经下定决心了吗？真是难以理解啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不过，现在她已经被击倒了。或许就这样结束了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我相信她能够坚持到最后。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "算了，既然你都这么说了……随他们去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "发生什么我都不管啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "泉，谢谢你的理解。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那么，现在还需要冰棍吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这时，在会场内的擂台上——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "还不能……就这样倒下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "真乃选手，她站起来了！对决还没有结束！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "观众席上响起了此起彼伏的喝彩声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "呼——吓我一跳。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "抱歉……刚才没调整好受击姿势。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "在赛场上，没有人需要道歉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "……我想知道，仓田流是攻防一体的格斗术，分家擅长的是守势，为何要急着进攻？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "如果拘泥于家传的流派，那就失去自己的特质了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "既然是最后的比赛，我想完全地遵循自己的本心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哪怕会面临惨败……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "是吗，你在寻求自己的答案吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "再来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "请多指教！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32526032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "永不言弃！仓田家兄妹的第二轮交锋即将开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-739",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
