      "title": "武道极意·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32529001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "站住。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "你要从水上斗技场逃跑吗，「王者」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "我已经不是了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "在这三周的时间，我见证了无数的斗士，也深深地认识到了自己的不足。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "到了开始下一段修行的时候了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "哼，居然在我准备参赛前就离开，真是让人火大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "等你修行回来，我们好好干一架。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "没有问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "一言为定。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "哟，两位的约定，能让我也听一下吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "总感觉——错过了不少切磋的机会。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这时，在远离M城的，某处遥远的海滨——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家的冷饮已经准备好了。给|101|的也有哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就这么放弃了「王者」的名号，不要紧吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我还很不成熟，还远远没到接下这个称号的水平……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "但是，我会继续努力的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "话说回来，伊迪丝还真是慷慨。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "毕竟真乃的表现这么好，让管理局超额完成了活动的人气……呃，是叫KPI对吧，KPI。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但没想到能让手办们都来海边……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "等这次度假结束，我就要去那个「管理局」帮忙了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊，是伊迪丝的要求吗？果然，她不会做亏本的交易。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不是的哦，我是自愿的，我只是想为主人……为手办们做些力所能及的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我想守护大家现在平静祥和的生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就像「英雄」一样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "就像「英雄」一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯，我去把冷饮分给大家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "泉她们几个应该在沙滩上打排球吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "接好了，这就是我的夏季大三角螺旋扣球！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啧，速度好快！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "……人质「向日葵沙雕」被消灭了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "抱歉抱歉！没控制好角度……等下给你堆一个更大的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家可以来喝冷饮了，人人有份，是最新的清凉涂料哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这个口味可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "……谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这不是挺有礼貌的吗？我要橙子味的，谢啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啰嗦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……这就是伊迪丝小姐所说的「好好享受这个夏日」吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "如果每年的夏天，都能这样度过就好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就约好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529044",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "阳光，沙滩，碧海……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32529045",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "夏日的故事永不完结。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
